@startuml 07-class-transaction-service
title transaction-service - Diagrama de clases (hexagonal)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty members

' Nucleo: RxJava 3 | Infraestructura: Reactor (conversion en los adaptadores)

package "domain" <<Rectangle>> {
  class Movement {
    -id : String
    -productId : UUID
    -productType : ProductType
    -movementType : MovementType
    -amount : Money
    -description : String
    -createdAt : Instant
  }
  class Money <<value object>> {
    -amount : BigDecimal
    -currency : String
  }
  enum ProductType {
    BANK_ACCOUNT
    CREDIT
    CREDIT_CARD
  }
  enum MovementType {
    DEPOSIT
    WITHDRAWAL
    PAYMENT
    CHARGE
  }
  class ResourceNotFoundException
}

package "application.port.in" <<Rectangle>> {
  interface RegisterMovementUseCase {
    +register(RegisterMovementCommand) : Single<RegisterMovementResult>
  }
  interface GetMovementsUseCase {
    +findAll(MovementFilter, CursorPageQuery) : Single<MovementPage>
    +findById(String) : Single<Movement>
  }
  interface UpdateMovementUseCase {
    +update(String, UpdateMovementCommand) : Single<Movement>
  }
  interface DeleteMovementUseCase {
    +delete(String) : Completable
  }
  class RegisterMovementCommand <<record>>
  class UpdateMovementCommand <<record>>
  class MovementFilter <<record>> {
    productId, productType, from, to
  }
  class CursorPageQuery <<record>> {
    limit : int (default 50, max 200)
    cursor : String
  }
  class MovementPage <<record>> {
    items : List<Movement>
    nextCursor : String
  }
  class RegisterMovementResult <<record>> {
    movement : Movement
    created : boolean
  }
}

package "application.port.out" <<Rectangle>> {
  interface MovementRepositoryPort {
    +save(Movement) : Single<Movement>
    +findById(String) : Maybe<Movement>
    +findAll(MovementFilter, CursorPageQuery) : Flowable<Movement>
    +deleteById(String) : Completable
  }
}

package "application.service" <<Rectangle>> {
  class MovementCommandService
  class MovementQueryService
}

package "infrastructure.adapter.in" <<Rectangle>> {
  class MovementController <<inbound adapter>> {
    rutas internas / administrativas
  }
  class MovementRestMapper
  class GlobalExceptionHandler {
    mapea errores a RFC 7807
  }
}

package "infrastructure.adapter.out" <<Rectangle>> {
  class MongoMovementRepositoryAdapter <<outbound adapter>>
  interface MovementMongoRepository <<Spring Data Reactive Mongo>>
  class MovementDocument {
    indice: productId + createdAt desc
  }
}

RegisterMovementUseCase <|.. MovementCommandService
UpdateMovementUseCase <|.. MovementCommandService
DeleteMovementUseCase <|.. MovementCommandService
GetMovementsUseCase <|.. MovementQueryService

MovementCommandService ..> MovementRepositoryPort
MovementQueryService ..> MovementRepositoryPort
MovementQueryService ..> ResourceNotFoundException

MovementRepositoryPort <|.. MongoMovementRepositoryAdapter
MongoMovementRepositoryAdapter ..> MovementMongoRepository
MongoMovementRepositoryAdapter ..> MovementDocument

MovementController ..> RegisterMovementUseCase
MovementController ..> GetMovementsUseCase
MovementController ..> UpdateMovementUseCase
MovementController ..> DeleteMovementUseCase
MovementController ..> MovementRestMapper

Movement --> ProductType
Movement --> MovementType
Movement *-- Money

note bottom of MovementCommandService
  RegisterMovementResult es un tipo interno del caso de uso.
  MovementController extrae su campo movement y responde
  al cliente con el recurso Movement (201 Created).
  findAll(): MovementPage lleva nextCursor, que el
  controlador expone en la cabecera X-Next-Cursor.
  update/delete son administrativos y quedan marcados
  como internos (alternativa: reversas auditables).
end note

@enduml
